BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Traveling Office Hours with Kerry Thomson
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260707T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260707T133000
UID:260626IUVC57V-j0GiPmnvI_CSHg
DESCRIPTION:Join Mayor Kerry Thomson for her Traveling Office Hours on Tue
 sday\, July 7 between 11:30 a.m. and 1:30 p.m. at YMCA of Monroe County - 
 Southeast\, 2125 S. Highland Ave.\, Bloomington IN\, 47401.\n\nThis is you
 r chance to engage with the Mayor in an informal setting\, ask questions\,
  receive updates on local initiatives\, and share any feedback you may hav
 e.\n\nAppointments will be scheduled in 15-minute intervals to ensure ever
 yone has an opportunity to connect. Pre-registration is required at **bto
 n.in/OfcHrs26**.\n\nWhy attend?\n\nTo best serve our community\, we need t
 o stay connected to it. This means prioritizing listening to the people of
  Bloomington and understanding their needs. These Traveling Office Hours p
 rovide a relaxed and personal environment for residents to interact with M
 ayor Thomson.\n\nPlease note: If you've already connected with Mayor Thoms
 on during Traveling Office Hours\, please refrain from registering at this
  time to provide others with the opportunity.
LOCATION:YMCA of Monroe County - Southeast
URL:https://forms.fillout.com/t/8VkHoRUeChus
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
