  Women & small farmers PLUS produce from our very own Greenhouse. Best way
  to get your share of fresh produce is to buy a CSA bag \\(Co-op Supported
  Agriculture\\) from our website! You get a full bag of seasonal produce f
 or $15! Plus add eggs for $5! This is over $60 in value! Buy weekly or add
  a monthly subscription! Special events this summer include: Juneteenth Ce
 lebration\, Summertime Celebration in July\, August Youth Day Event! Join 
 us at People's Market every week 10am to 2pm at First United Church in the
  Fellowship Hall 2420 E 3rd st. Bloomington IN
