BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Piano (1993) 4K Restoration
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260807T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260807T190000
UID:260630DYOV6Pu3yk-3TyZ2FCDdMQ
DESCRIPTION:After a long voyage from Scotland\, pianist Ada McGrath (Holly
  Hunter) and her young daughter\, Flora (Anna Paquin)\, are left with all 
 their belongings\, including a piano\, on a New Zealand beach. Ada\, who h
 as been mute since childhood\, has been sold into marriage to a local man 
 named Alisdair Stewart (Sam Neill). Making little attempt to warm up to Al
 isdair\, Ada soon becomes intrigued by his Maori-friendly acquaintance\, G
 eorge Baines (Harvey Keitel)\, leading to tense\, life-altering conflicts.
 \n\nJane Campion’s 1993 Palme d’Or-winning classic ***The Piano*** h
 as received a stunning 4K restoration\, featuring Dolby Vision HDR. Superv
 ised by Campion and cinematographer Stuart Dryburgh\, it was scanned from 
 the original 35mm negative.\n\nRATING: R\n\nRUNTIME: 2hrs 1min\n\nFORMAT: 
 Digitally Restored 4K DCP
LOCATION:Buskirk Chumley Theater
URL:https://buskirkchumley.org/events/the-piano-1993-4k-restoration-august
 -7-2026/
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
