DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260808T210000
UID:260701LVC1QuNlkUmxvTPQbYOJ4Q
DESCRIPTION:The Lake Monroe Water Fund’s annual Beach Bash is an evening
  of lakeside fun\, community connection\, and conservation impact. Held at
  Fourwinds Lakeside Inn on beautiful Lake Monroe\, this family-friendly ev
 ent brings people together to celebrate and support clean water. Enjoy liv
 e music\, lawn games\, a silent auction\, giveaways\, and  two local food
  trucks\, plus a relaxed\, beachy atmosphere for all ages.
LOCATION:Four Winds Lakeside Inn and Marina 
URL:https://www.lakemonroewaterfund.org/beachbash
X-SOURCE:Limestone Post
END:VEVENT
