DESCRIPTION:**The GREATEST ELVIS CONCERT EXPERIENCE IN AMERICA is RETURNIN
 G to the Buskirk-Chumley Theater on August 21st!**\n\nInternationally reco
 gnized by Graceland and the Elvis Presley Estate\, the show’s star\, **
 Matt Stone**\, performs the CLOSEST THING to the King in history! Matt bri
 ngs a never-before-seen level of authenticity and attention to detail to h
 is craft\, CAPTIVATING audiences with flawless recreation of the King of R
 ock ’n’ Roll in his prime!\n\nHe’s not an “Elvis impersonator\,”
  but a talented vocalist portraying the GREATEST ENTERTAINER OF ALL TIME i
 n a theatrical production— and after seeing this ELECTRIFYING SPECTACLE\
 , you’ll remember ELVIS THE ICON\, and forget the punchline.\n\nHe has e
 arned the approval of Elvis’ friends and family\, who have said:\n\n“W
 hen I heard \\[Matt\\]… now if I close my eyes that’s Elvis! It touche
 d my heart. The only person I ever heard sing like that was my brother\, a
 nd \\[Matt\\] was real close—SCARY— that’s how close it was.” -Bil
 ly Stanley (Elvis’ Step Brother)\n\n“Matt is incredibly gifted & hands
 ome\, with incredible energy and sex appeal.” – Joyce Bova (Longtime E
 lvis Girlfriend)\n\nHe has even been heard on SiriusXM’s ELVIS RADIO!\n\
 nBacked by a sensational all-star band\, Matt Stone MESMERIZES fans into b
 lue-suede bliss as they’re HYPNOTIZED into thinking Elvis is BACK IN THE
  BUILDING at the PEAK of his prowess!
